2042
02:49:29,960 --> 02:49:40,980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Paano natin may ensure na yung listahan na po ito, kumpleto, ito po ay na-check na, kumbaga, at hindi po mawawala?

2043
02:50:09,150 --> 02:50:21,340
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Madam Speaker, mayroon pong signed terms of reference ang MCB at saka ang NHA

2044
02:50:21,360 --> 02:50:32,240
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: para sigurado na maayos yung transition of files ng MCB to NHA.

2045
02:50:33,200 --> 02:50:42,300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So nagbibigay po ng paninigurado at commitment ang MCV na ang transition ng mga documents ay magiging maayos,

2046
02:50:42,840 --> 02:50:49,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi po sana mawawala yung mga listahan at kung may validation na kailangan gawin ay gagawin po, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

2047
02:50:49,580 --> 02:50:50,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tama po ba yun?

2048
02:50:51,360 --> 02:50:53,160
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Yes, Your Honor, Madam Speaker.

2049
02:50:54,160 --> 02:51:09,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, ang huli na lang nating tanong ay nakita naman natin na nakakaantig ng puso na a small fraction of the targeted permanent housing units

2050
02:51:09,480 --> 02:51:13,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang natuturn over pa lamang sa displaced residents.

2051
02:51:14,900 --> 02:51:21,300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron po bang concrete steps na ginagawa to accelerate turnover?

2052
02:51:21,360 --> 02:51:22,980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

2053
02:51:31,980 --> 02:51:37,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Actually, wala na sa MCV yun.

2054
02:51:37,200 --> 02:51:50,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: NHA na ang mag-continue ng lahat ng dapat ayusin para tuloy-tuloy na mabigyan ng mga...

2055
02:51:51,360 --> 02:51:54,060
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: na claimants ng competition.

2056
02:51:54,980 --> 02:51:58,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero tama po ba, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, wala pa sa NHA sa ngayon.

2057
02:51:58,560 --> 02:52:09,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, nasa kapangyarihan pa rin po ng MCV sa ngayon na tumaha ng concrete steps to accelerate unit turnover.

2058
02:52:10,680 --> 02:52:16,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, baka po pwedeng makapagdetali ano po yung pwedeng magawa para po mas mapabilis pa.

2059
02:52:16,780 --> 02:52:21,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo na't ayaw din naman nating paabutin sa sunset clause.

2060
02:52:21,360 --> 02:52:30,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, bago po, may marami pa rin naghihintay dito sa turnover.

2061
02:52:40,320 --> 02:52:47,460
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Ang NHA ang sa settlement at ang MCB ay sa compensation lang.

2062
02:52:49,320 --> 02:52:50,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

2063
02:52:50,860 --> 02:52:54,060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Marami pa rin pong may concerns sa Marawi Compensation Board.

2064
02:52:54,620 --> 02:53:00,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Magiging bukas po ba ang MCV sa isang dialogo sa mga internally displaced persons,

2065
02:53:01,860 --> 02:53:08,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa lahat ng mga apektadong sektor para po mas mapabilis yung hindi lang turnover ng unit,

2066
02:53:09,380 --> 02:53:17,720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero ma-streamline yung concerns at maayos na matawid yung kanilang mga hinahing para po maaksyonan ng MCV?

2067
02:53:18,580 --> 02:53:20,720
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Willing po ang MCV na...

2068
02:53:20,860 --> 02:53:32,180
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Makipag-dialog para sa lahat ng kailangan gawin sa mga claimants, Your Honor, Mr. Speaker.

2069
02:53:33,180 --> 02:53:43,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat po. Let the record reflect ang pagbukas sa dialogo na gusto po natin sa susunod at sa malapit na panahon ay mangyari

2070
02:53:43,700 --> 02:53:50,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para po yung ating mga naging issue na ina-identify ay mabilis po.

2071
02:53:50,860 --> 02:53:58,340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At sana po yung NHA, sila din po ay appraised nun sa mga steps na tinitake natin.

2072
02:53:58,620 --> 02:54:01,080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, that is all. Thank you very much.

2073
02:54:01,140 --> 02:54:01,960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

2074
02:54:02,280 --> 02:54:07,340
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: Madam Speaker, may recognize Representative Sara Elago for her interpellation.

2075
02:54:07,520 --> 02:54:10,300
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Elago is hereby recognized for interpellation.

2076
02:54:13,800 --> 02:54:15,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

2077
02:54:15,620 --> 02:54:20,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nais ko na lamang pong maituloy yung pagtatanong ng ating mga kasamahan tungkol sa...

2078
02:54:20,860 --> 02:54:22,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: PONDO ng MCB.

2079
02:54:24,700 --> 02:54:33,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayon ho sa ulat ng MCB, as of August 31, 2026, mayroon itong 4.362 billion total appropriations,

2080
02:54:34,160 --> 02:54:37,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung saan 2.362 billion ang released allotments.

2081
02:54:38,100 --> 02:54:45,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakasaad din na mayroon pang 2 billion pesos na unallocated amount pending further release from DBM.

2082
02:54:45,000 --> 02:54:46,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari ba nating malaman?

2083
02:54:47,320 --> 02:54:50,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ang dahilan kung bakit hindi pa nailalabas ang natitirapan?

2084
02:54:50,860 --> 02:54:52,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Parang 2 billion pesos.

2085
02:55:03,780 --> 02:55:12,860
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Actually, hindi pa na-re-release yung 2 billion from DBM, Your Honor.

2086
02:55:14,400 --> 02:55:18,260
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: And I have the review pa ng DBM, Your Honor.

2087
02:55:19,540 --> 02:55:20,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At Madam Speaker,

2088
02:55:20,860 --> 02:55:22,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay ma-re-release na ito.

2089
02:55:22,180 --> 02:55:29,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil sinabi din ng MCB na pagkatapos ng 2026 ay wala na silang matitira na pondo.

2090
02:55:30,040 --> 02:55:38,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalo na para sa 2027 ay napakaliit lamang ng kanilang pondo na naisama sa General Appropriations Bill

2091
02:55:38,700 --> 02:55:42,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: habang napakaraming mga pending pang-claims.

2092
02:55:43,140 --> 02:55:50,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, ang MCB po ay nailikha sa ilalim ng Republic Act No. 11696 at nagsimula.

2093
02:55:50,860 --> 02:55:55,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang operations noong January 30, 2023.

2094
02:55:56,040 --> 02:56:00,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakatakdang matapos ang five-year mandate nito sa June 3, 2028.

2095
02:56:00,620 --> 02:56:05,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: As of August 2026, may halos dalawang taon na lamang ang board.

2096
02:56:06,280 --> 02:56:13,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa kasalukuyang mga backlog at funding requirements na narinig po natin sa ating deliberasyon ngayong gabi,

2097
02:56:13,940 --> 02:56:23,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kumpiyansa po ba ang Marawi Compensation Board na matatapos nito ang lahat ng statutory responsibilities nito

2098
02:56:23,600 --> 02:56:25,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bago mag-expire ang kanyang mandato?

2099
02:56:28,020 --> 02:56:29,900
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Your Honor, Madam Speaker,

2100
02:56:30,960 --> 02:56:37,820
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: pagdating sa adjudication process, matatapos nila,

2101
02:56:38,900 --> 02:56:48,860
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: ang hindi lang nila magagawa ay yung makapag-disburse dahil kulang ang ating pondong inilaan

2102
02:56:48,860 --> 02:56:49,860
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: para sa mga...

2103
02:56:50,860 --> 02:56:55,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Narinig natin, Madam Speaker, na kulang ang pondo.

2104
02:56:55,940 --> 02:57:01,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung hindi matatapos ang lahat ng claims bago ang June 2028,

2105
02:57:01,760 --> 02:57:04,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron bang contingency plan ang ating pamahalaan?

2106
02:57:05,940 --> 02:57:12,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sino ang magpapatuloy ng proseso ng pagtitiyak ng compensation,

2107
02:57:12,740 --> 02:57:16,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng reparation, lahat ng pagbabayad ng remaining claims?

2108
02:57:18,000 --> 02:57:20,580
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Actually, Madam Speaker, Your Honor,

2109
02:57:20,860 --> 02:57:25,300
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: nasa batas naman na ang magti-takeover ay ang DHSUD.

2110
02:57:26,680 --> 02:57:35,300
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: So, DHSUD na ang magpapatuloy para sa processing ng mga compensation para sa mga claimant.

2111
02:57:37,700 --> 02:57:39,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Disyud na ang magpapatuloy.

2112
02:57:39,920 --> 02:57:47,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit, paano po maapektuhan ang inyong trabaho ng Executive Order No. 78

2113
02:57:47,340 --> 02:57:50,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pinirmahan noong November 28, 2024?

2114
02:57:50,860 --> 02:57:56,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sabi po dito ang magsisilbi na sekretariat

2115
02:57:56,220 --> 02:58:07,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: or magiging attached ang board dito sa Office of the Presidential Advisor for Marawi Rehabilitation and Development

2116
02:58:07,580 --> 02:58:10,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para daw po sa policy and program coordination

2117
02:58:10,960 --> 02:58:16,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matiyak ang consistency ng goals at objectives ng MCB

2118
02:58:16,160 --> 02:58:19,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa lahat ng policies at trust ng national government.

2119
02:58:19,340 --> 02:58:20,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin po ba nito?

2120
02:58:20,860 --> 02:58:29,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maski po yung role ninyo bilang attached sa Office of the Presidential Advisor for Marawi Rehabilitation and Development

2121
02:58:29,860 --> 02:58:32,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay hanggang 2028 na lamang po?

2122
02:58:38,860 --> 02:58:49,860
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Mukhang ganun po ang mangyayari dahil yung MCB wala nang tapos na yung kanilang lifespan.

2123
02:58:50,860 --> 02:58:56,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, kung ang mga miyembro ngayon ng Marawi Compensation Board

2124
02:58:56,860 --> 02:59:03,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang pipili at poposisyon, sa tingin niyo po ba dapat i-extend ang mandato ng Marawi Compensation Board

2125
02:59:03,860 --> 02:59:09,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hanggat sa hindi natatapos yung pagbabayad ng mga remaining claims?

2126
02:59:09,860 --> 02:59:16,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Siyempre po, dapat matiyak na matapos ito sa takdang panahon at hindi yung pangmatagalan.

2127
02:59:16,860 --> 02:59:18,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi yun na nga yung nangyari po ngayon.

2128
02:59:18,860 --> 02:59:19,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natumagal na.

2129
02:59:19,860 --> 02:59:26,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na halos magsasampung taon na, nang hindi pa rin natitiyak yung mabilis na pagbabayad ng mga claims.

2130
02:59:26,860 --> 02:59:35,860
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Mas maganda sana kung makakaroon ng extension pero siguro makangailangan niya ng batas.

2131
02:59:35,860 --> 02:59:47,860
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: May mga bills ang alam ko sa Congress at sa Senate to extend the life of Marawi Compensation Board.

2132
02:59:47,860 --> 02:59:57,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, ang datos mismo ng Marawi Compensation Board ay nagpapakita na malaki na ang pondong nailabas para sa Compensation Program.

2133
02:59:57,860 --> 02:59:59,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit mayroon pa rin...

2134
03:00:00,000 --> 03:00:05,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mas malaking bilang pa ng claims na kailangang risolbahin at pondohan.

2135
03:00:05,720 --> 03:00:11,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: As of August 2026, 5,945 claims remain pending.

2136
03:00:12,300 --> 03:00:19,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa ating 2027 General Appropriations Bill, naglalaan lamang ng 1 billion pesos para sa compensation program

2137
03:00:19,920 --> 03:00:27,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kumpara sa malaking kinakailangan na 5.28 billion proposal ng board.

2138
03:00:27,060 --> 03:00:35,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang funding gap ay tumataginting po napakalaki na 4.015 billion pesos.

2139
03:00:35,520 --> 03:00:41,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya napakahalagang malinaw na hindi lamang kung gaano karaming claims ang naprocess,

2140
03:00:41,800 --> 03:00:46,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kundi dapat may sapat at tiyak na pondo para sa lahat ng claimants,

2141
03:00:46,780 --> 03:00:50,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na matitiyak natin na may mekanismo ng transparency,

2142
03:00:51,120 --> 03:00:56,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: matitiyak na ang bawat piso ng pondo ay madidiretsyo mismo sa mga claimants

2143
03:00:56,380 --> 03:01:01,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ating mga kababayan na apektado bago matapos ang mandato ng board.

2144
03:01:02,000 --> 03:01:08,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At bilang panghuli, kinatawagan na rin natin ang Kongreso na ito na magpatawag po sana tayo

2145
03:01:08,440 --> 03:01:19,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng pagdinig tungkol sa potensyal sa posible na pag-extend ng taon ng mandato ng Marawi Compensation Board

2146
03:01:19,260 --> 03:01:25,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para lang po sa interes ng karapatang pantao, para sa interes ng justisya,

2147
03:01:25,180 --> 03:01:26,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa interes.

2148
03:01:26,380 --> 03:01:37,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng pagtitiyak na nga nararapat na kompensasyon at reparasyon sa lahat ng mga 2017 Marawi Siege internally displaced persons.

2149
03:01:37,740 --> 03:01:41,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming maraming salamat Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat sa ating distinguished sponsor.

2150
03:01:42,380 --> 03:01:43,220
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

2151
03:01:45,100 --> 03:01:52,840
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Antonio Tinio.

2152
03:01:52,840 --> 03:01:55,790
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Tinio is recognized

2153
03:01:56,030 --> 03:01:57,400
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: of ACT Teachers for his interpellation

2154
03:01:57,400 --> 03:02:00,220
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: on the proposed budget of the MCB.

2155
03:02:02,460 --> 03:02:12,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you Madam Speaker. Madam Speaker, maraming na pong natanong at pasisimple na lang po natin

2156
03:02:12,880 --> 03:02:20,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at ididin yung mga importanteng punto kaugnay sa budget ng Marawi Compensation Board.

2157
03:02:21,800 --> 03:02:25,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, pakikita nga po natin na ang proposed budget ay

2158
03:02:26,380 --> 03:02:40,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 1.247 billion pesos at sa halagang yun ay 1 billion pesos ang para sa Marawi Siege Victims Compensation Fund.

2159
03:02:41,660 --> 03:02:52,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nabanggit na po na papalapit na ang katapusan ng mandato ng Marawi Compensation Board.

2160
03:02:52,800 --> 03:02:55,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, sabi nga doon sa Republic Act 11696.

2161
03:02:56,380 --> 03:02:59,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Merong sunset clause.

2162
03:02:59,880 --> 03:03:00,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

2163
03:03:00,820 --> 03:03:01,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At sabi rito,

2164
03:03:01,600 --> 03:03:07,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The board shall complete its work within five years from the effectivity of the IRR.

2165
03:03:08,320 --> 03:03:11,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: After such period, it shall become punctus officio.

2166
03:03:13,620 --> 03:03:19,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pagkatapos nun, ipapasa na sa DSUD.

2167
03:03:20,180 --> 03:03:26,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The DSUD shall continue to exercise the powers and functions of the board.

2168
03:03:26,200 --> 03:03:32,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to disburse and process any and all pending compensation due to qualified claimants.

2169
03:03:33,460 --> 03:03:35,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ganun po ang nakatakda sa batas.

2170
03:03:35,280 --> 03:03:44,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of course, dapat ituring ang sunset clause na ito bilang hamon sa kasalukuyang board.

2171
03:03:45,380 --> 03:03:53,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Huwag na nating intayin na umabot yung deadline at may maiwan pang trabaho sa DSUD.

2172
03:03:53,280 --> 03:03:55,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ngayon,

2173
03:03:56,200 --> 03:03:58,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ulitin lang natin,

2174
03:03:59,680 --> 03:04:02,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang Pondo for Compensation ngayon ay 1 billion.

2175
03:04:03,140 --> 03:04:06,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, malinaw po, nadiinan na, kapos ito.

2176
03:04:07,200 --> 03:04:14,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Magkano po ang kailangan pa para makompleto ang trabaho ng compensation

2177
03:04:14,140 --> 03:04:23,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: bago marating yung dulo o wakas ng mandato

2178
03:04:23,340 --> 03:04:24,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng

2179
03:04:26,200 --> 03:04:29,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Marawi Compensation Board? Ito po ay sa

2180
03:04:29,200 --> 03:04:33,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: after May 31, 2028. Tama po ba?

2181
03:04:33,200 --> 03:04:36,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Tama po.

2182
03:04:36,200 --> 03:04:43,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At magkano po ang kabuuang kailangan para sa ilang bilang ng mga victims?

2183
03:04:43,200 --> 03:04:44,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Climants?

2184
03:04:44,200 --> 03:04:47,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Mangangailangan po tayo, Madam Speaker,

2185
03:04:47,200 --> 03:04:49,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Mr. Sponsor,

2186
03:04:49,200 --> 03:04:51,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: distinguished colleague,

2187
03:04:51,200 --> 03:04:54,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: na mga 6.6 billion

2188
03:04:54,200 --> 03:04:55,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: on top of 1 billion.

2189
03:04:55,200 --> 03:05:05,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, total kailangan, 7.6 billion for 2027, 1 billion lamang

2190
03:05:05,200 --> 03:05:15,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang nakalaan. At muli, yung 1 billion ay para sa ilang bilang po ito muli ng claimants?

2191
03:05:15,200 --> 03:05:19,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: 4,360 claimants.

2192
03:05:19,200 --> 03:05:21,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 4,000?

2193
03:05:21,200 --> 03:05:24,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: For the total, 7.6 billion.

2194
03:05:24,890 --> 03:05:25,250
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2195
03:05:25,680 --> 03:05:30,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Ang claimants na pwedeng mabigyan is 4,300.

2196
03:05:30,200 --> 03:05:34,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 4,300. So, yung 1 billion po, ilan lang po ang mabibigyan diyan?

2197
03:05:34,200 --> 03:05:38,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: 760.

2198
03:05:38,200 --> 03:05:52,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 760 lamang po. So, well, sa proposed budget for 2027, nakatali po ang kamay

2199
03:05:52,200 --> 03:05:56,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng Marawi Compensation Board.

2200
03:05:56,200 --> 03:05:59,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 700, ilan po?

2201
03:05:59,200 --> 03:06:02,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: 760 claimants.

2202
03:06:02,200 --> 03:06:06,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 760 claimants lang po ang mabibigyan.

2203
03:06:06,200 --> 03:06:20,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang usapin lang naman po rito ay ano ba ang kakayanin ng Marawi Compensation Board?

2204
03:06:20,200 --> 03:06:41,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Padaling sabihin, dagdagan natin ang pondo pero kaya bang ma-award ng Marawi Compensation Board ang mas malaking bilang kesa dito sa 760 families?

2205
03:06:41,200 --> 03:06:44,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po ang kayang gawin?

2206
03:06:44,200 --> 03:06:54,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Distinguished colleague, Madam Speaker, kayang-kaya po yan. Ang kailangan lang po natin ay pondo.

2207
03:06:54,200 --> 03:07:02,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kayang-kaya. Magbigay po tayo ng kongkretong numero. Ano ang kakayanin?

2208
03:07:02,200 --> 03:07:08,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Actually, yung 760, one to two months.

2209
03:07:08,200 --> 03:07:11,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In one to two months ay kaya po yan?

2210
03:07:11,200 --> 03:07:12,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Kaya bigyan.

2211
03:07:12,200 --> 03:07:13,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Opo.

2212
03:07:13,200 --> 03:07:25,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Kung may pondo po tayo, eh bago mag-lapse yung mandato, mapoprovide po natin, mabibigyan po natin yung lahat ng claimants.

2213
03:07:29,200 --> 03:07:41,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Baka may maibigay po kayong mas kongkretong target na kakayanin realistically sa isang taon, fiscal year 2027.

2214
03:07:43,200 --> 03:07:52,200
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: We request the distinguished sponsor to give an estimate. Ilan ang kakayanin?

2215
03:07:52,200 --> 03:07:57,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: 3,500 sa isang taon, Your Honor.

2216
03:07:57,200 --> 03:08:06,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 3,500. Hindi lang 760, kundi 3,500 claimants ang kayang mabigyan.

2217
03:08:06,200 --> 03:08:07,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Yes, Your Honor.

2218
03:08:07,200 --> 03:08:12,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Magkano po ang kailangan pondo para sa 3,500 na yan?

2219
03:08:12,200 --> 03:08:20,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: 5 billion, Madam Speaker.

2220
03:08:20,200 --> 03:08:27,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 5 billion pesos. Okay. So, kung may 1 billion na kailangan dagdagan ng 4, ganun po ba?

2221
03:08:27,200 --> 03:08:28,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Tama po. Tama po.

2222
03:08:28,200 --> 03:08:30,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 4 billion pesos additional.

2223
03:08:30,200 --> 03:08:31,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 4 billion.

2224
03:08:31,200 --> 03:08:40,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Well, Madam Speaker, malinaw naman po narinig natin na sabi ng Marawi Compensation Board,

2225
03:08:40,200 --> 03:08:55,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kaya daw nila makapagbigay, mag-award to 3,600 families at mangangailangan ng additional 4 billion pesos.

2226
03:08:55,200 --> 03:09:05,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ito po ba ay naparating ng Marawi Compensation Board sa Committee on Appropriations sa takdang panahon?

2227
03:09:10,200 --> 03:09:14,200
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: May we get a yes or no from the sponsor?

2228
03:09:14,200 --> 03:09:21,200
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Mukhang nagsend ng letter.

2229
03:09:21,200 --> 03:09:25,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagsend ng letter. Okay. So, malinaw po, Madam Speaker.

2230
03:09:25,200 --> 03:09:37,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang kinatawang ito ay sumusuporta po sa request for institutional amendment ng Marawi Compensation Board

2231
03:09:37,200 --> 03:09:53,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for an additional 4 billion, pero pangahawakan po natin ang kanilang deklarasyon dito na kaya nilang ma-award ang pondo,

2232
03:09:53,200 --> 03:09:58,850
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang dagdag na pondo to 3,600.

2233
03:09:58,850 --> 03:09:59,410
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Tama, tama.

2234
03:09:59,410 --> 03:10:05,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 3,600 claimants.

2235
03:10:05,300 --> 03:10:07,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun po ang pinakamahalaga.

2236
03:10:07,500 --> 03:10:14,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, kanina meron pong mga youth from Marawi.

2237
03:10:14,200 --> 03:10:23,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagpunta pa sila dito sa Maynila para nga makaharap ang Marawi Compensation Board.

2238
03:10:23,200 --> 03:10:30,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At hinaharap naman tayo ni Chair Macarambon at ng kanyang mga staff.

2239
03:10:30,200 --> 03:10:32,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Papasalamat po tayo doon.

2240
03:10:32,200 --> 03:10:36,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Isa sa mga urgent request po nila ay yung director.

2241
03:10:36,200 --> 03:10:39,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ay yung direktang harapan, dialogue.

2242
03:10:39,200 --> 03:10:50,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil kailangan-kailangan ng opisyal at klarong informasyon tungkol sa ano na ba ang kalagayan

2243
03:10:50,200 --> 03:10:57,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng mga matagal nang iniintay na pag-award ng claims.

2244
03:10:57,200 --> 03:11:05,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At gusto lang po natin mailagay on record na may commitment po

2245
03:11:05,200 --> 03:11:11,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for a dialogue in Marawi led by the Marawi Compensation Board.

2246
03:11:11,200 --> 03:11:16,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang tinarget po doon ay first week of October.

2247
03:11:16,200 --> 03:11:20,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, confirm po ba yung commitment na iyon?

2248
03:11:20,200 --> 03:11:23,980
Rep. Nicanor M. Briones: Yes, Your Honor. Confirm po yung commitment.

2249
03:11:23,980 --> 03:11:27,770
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you. Maraming salamat po. So, yun lang po.

2250
03:11:27,770 --> 03:11:29,320
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you very much, Honorable Tinio, Majority Leader.

2251
03:11:29,360 --> 03:11:32,190
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun lang po, Madam Speaker, nagpapasalamat tayo.

2252
03:11:32,200 --> 03:11:34,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Muli, sinusuportahan natin.

2253
03:11:34,200 --> 03:11:43,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung request ng Marawi Compensation Board for additional 4 billion pesos

2254
03:11:43,200 --> 03:11:46,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para magampanan nila ang kanilang mandato.

2255
03:11:46,200 --> 03:11:55,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And we look forward to their commitment na haharapin yung mga mamamayan ng Marawi sa Marawi mismo

2256
03:11:55,200 --> 03:11:57,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pagbalik nila doon sa Oktubre.

2257
03:11:57,200 --> 03:12:00,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hanggang doon na lamang po, Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat.

2258
03:12:00,660 --> 03:12:04,490
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: May be the Honorable Tinio would also like to move for the termination of the meeting.

2259
03:12:05,350 --> 03:12:06,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes, Madam Speaker.

2260
03:12:07,240 --> 03:12:12,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: There being no other member of the minority who wishes to interpolate,

2261
03:12:12,200 --> 03:12:19,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I move for the termination of the period of interpolation and debate

2262
03:12:19,200 --> 03:12:23,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on the budget of the Marawi Compensation Board.

2263
03:12:23,200 --> 03:12:24,200
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

2264
03:12:24,200 --> 03:12:30,200
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: Madam Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority in the motion to terminate

2265
03:12:30,200 --> 03:12:33,200
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: the period of interpolation of the proposal, Marawi Compensation Board.

2266
03:12:33,200 --> 03:12:39,680
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: There is a joint motion to terminate the period of interpellations

2267
03:12:39,680 --> 03:12:43,220
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: on the proposed budget of the Marawi Compensation Board.

2268
03:12:43,660 --> 03:12:44,580
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Is there any objection?

2269
03:12:45,160 --> 03:12:46,280
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Chair hears none.

2270
03:12:47,300 --> 03:12:49,880
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The period of debate, sponsorship debate and interpellation

2271
03:12:49,880 --> 03:12:53,060
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: of the proposed budget of the Marawi Compensation Board

2272
03:12:53,060 --> 03:12:54,380
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: is hereby terminated.

2273
