Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader?

2274
03:12:58,560 --> 03:13:02,800
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Madam Speaker, I move to consider the proposed budget

2275
03:13:02,800 --> 03:13:05,900
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: of the Bases Conversion and Development Authority.

2276
03:13:07,280 --> 03:13:11,860
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And may we acknowledge the heads...

2277
03:13:11,860 --> 03:13:12,880
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Well, there's a pending motion.

2278
03:13:18,160 --> 03:13:22,400
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: There is a motion to consider the proposed budget

2279
03:13:22,400 --> 03:13:24,440
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: of the Bases Conversion and Development Authority.

2280
03:13:24,440 --> 03:13:27,700
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: There being no objections, that motion is carried.

2281
03:13:28,840 --> 03:13:31,520
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Madam Speaker, may we acknowledge the heads and officials

2282
03:13:31,520 --> 03:13:32,640
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: of the Bases

2283
03:13:32,800 --> 03:13:34,580
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Conversion and Development Authority,

2284
03:13:35,280 --> 03:13:38,440
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: namely President and CEO Joshua Bingcang,

2285
03:13:39,180 --> 03:13:40,520
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Director Glenn Albano,

2286
03:13:41,200 --> 03:13:42,840
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Director Dante Liban,

2287
03:13:43,740 --> 03:13:46,640
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Senior Vice President Hedda Rulona,

2288
03:13:47,220 --> 03:13:51,680
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Senior Vice President Diana Joyce Basco-Galera,

2289
03:13:52,480 --> 03:13:54,180
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Officer in Charge Mark Torres.

2290
03:13:54,740 --> 03:13:56,860
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you very much, Majority Leader.

2291
03:13:57,620 --> 03:14:00,800
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: May we request the Majority Leader to recognize the sponsor.

2292
03:14:02,800 --> 03:14:06,180
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize

2293
03:14:06,180 --> 03:14:10,660
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: the Honorable Maria Angela S. Garcia,

2294
03:14:11,500 --> 03:14:14,180
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Vice Chairperson of the Committee on Appropriations...

2295
03:14:14,180 --> 03:14:16,800
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Maria Angela Garcia is hereby recognized

2296
03:14:16,800 --> 03:14:18,460
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: to sponsor the proposed budget

2297
03:14:18,460 --> 03:14:21,360
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: of the Bases Conversion and Development Authority.

2298
03:14:22,320 --> 03:14:24,500
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker.

2299
03:14:24,980 --> 03:14:27,720
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: On behalf of the Committee on Appropriations,

2300
03:14:28,140 --> 03:14:30,280
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: I have the privilege of sponsoring

2301
03:14:31,280 --> 03:14:32,320
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: the proposed...

2302
03:14:32,320 --> 03:14:34,600
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Fiscal Year 2027 Budget

2303
03:14:34,600 --> 03:14:40,460
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: of the Bases Conversion and Development Authority.

2304
03:14:40,460 --> 03:14:45,760
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Together with President Joshua Bingcang

2305
03:14:45,760 --> 03:14:48,400
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: and the BCDA family,

2306
03:14:48,760 --> 03:14:51,140
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: we are ready to respond to the questions

2307
03:14:51,140 --> 03:14:55,740
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: of our esteemed colleagues during the interpellation.

2308
03:14:56,160 --> 03:14:57,180
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

2309
03:15:00,000 --> 03:15:09,260
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Madam Speaker, may we recognize the Honorable Dada Kiram Ismula of the Akbayan Partylist for her interpellation.

2310
03:15:10,320 --> 03:15:14,440
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Dada Kiram Ismula is hereby recognized.

2311
03:15:16,460 --> 03:15:19,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuhu.

2312
03:15:20,540 --> 03:15:28,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dediretso na po ako sa aking katanungan para po mabilis tayong matapos dahil 10.13 na rin po ng gabi.

2313
03:15:30,000 --> 03:15:37,640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nakasaad sa gab na iisa lamang ang line item ng BCDA para sa susunod na taon.

2314
03:15:37,740 --> 03:15:52,660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Malinaw po sa proposed appropriation na ang buong 1.983 billion ay para sa implementation ng BCDA Infrastructure Development Program at kaugnay nito,

2315
03:15:53,660 --> 03:15:59,900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ano ang specific na performance target ng BCDA na dapat ma-achieve?

2316
03:16:00,000 --> 03:16:02,720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa ilalim ng program na ito.

2317
03:16:03,640 --> 03:16:06,320
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

2318
03:16:06,700 --> 03:16:14,780
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ang targets po for 2027, ang isa pong target is the number of generated employment, 1,500.

2319
03:16:15,960 --> 03:16:28,280
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: The percentage of completed facilities constructed for the AFP, 100%, such as the Philippine Marine Headquarters, the Philippine Navy Senior Officers Quarters,

2320
03:16:28,880 --> 03:16:34,720
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: And the percentage of infrastructure projects implemented as planned, 100% din po.

2321
03:16:35,120 --> 03:16:42,360
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Such as the connecting road to the virology of DOST, the National Academy of Sports Dormitory of DepEd,

2322
03:16:42,360 --> 03:16:48,700
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: the access road leading to the Central Bank, University of the Philippines, and Philippine High School.

2323
03:16:50,660 --> 03:16:53,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

2324
03:16:53,420 --> 03:16:59,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: As we all know, ang issue ng Paxilica ay nangangailangan ng kalinawan.

2325
03:17:00,360 --> 03:17:06,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Iilang countries ang papasok dito sa Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park under sa Paxilica.

2326
03:17:07,500 --> 03:17:07,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilan po?

2327
03:17:09,020 --> 03:17:10,380
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

2328
03:17:10,680 --> 03:17:13,060
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Sa ngayon po, nothing is final yet.

2329
03:17:14,160 --> 03:17:17,680
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Hindi naman po ito US exclusive initiative.

2330
03:17:17,680 --> 03:17:23,120
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Dahil po as of June 2026, meron na pong 24 signatories.

2331
03:17:23,420 --> 03:17:25,420
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ang Paxilica Declaration.

2332
03:17:26,420 --> 03:17:42,800
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Kasama ang Pilipinas, United States, Australia, Japan, Republic of Korea, Singapore, the Netherlands, United Kingdom, India, Germany, Israel, United Arab Emirates, and other partner economies pa po.

2333
03:17:42,800 --> 03:17:53,400
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So, ina-expect po natin na iba-iba po yung mga bansa na pwedeng mag-locate sa Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park.

2334
03:17:53,420 --> 03:17:56,300
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ilan naman po kaya yung tech firm?

2335
03:17:58,180 --> 03:17:59,420
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Tech firm.

2336
03:17:59,860 --> 03:18:06,280
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Wala pa po tayong final reply dyan kasi po nothing is final po as of the moment.

2337
03:18:06,860 --> 03:18:09,240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po, Distinguished Sponsor.

2338
03:18:09,960 --> 03:18:12,860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dadako po ako sa aking pangatlong katanungan.

2339
03:18:13,380 --> 03:18:21,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano po kaya ang specific roles ng BCDA sa Paxilica at sa Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park?

2340
03:18:23,420 --> 03:18:30,640
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you, Madam Speaker. Ang BCDA po ay isang IPA or Investments Promotions Agency.

2341
03:18:30,960 --> 03:18:42,240
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So, yung role po niya ay limitado po sa pagiging isang commercial partner or lessor po ng CAMP or ng Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park.

2342
03:18:43,300 --> 03:18:45,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilang staff po ba meron ang BCDA?

2343
03:18:47,680 --> 03:18:52,900
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ang BCDA po sa kabuan ay meron pong 257 na staff.

2344
03:18:53,420 --> 03:18:54,420
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: 57?

2345
03:18:55,260 --> 03:18:55,420
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: 257.

2346
03:18:56,500 --> 03:18:57,900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 257. Salamat po.

2347
03:18:58,540 --> 03:19:04,460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilang staff naman po ang currently assigned sa Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park?

2348
03:19:04,980 --> 03:19:17,800
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Sa ngayon po, Madam Speaker, wala pa pong dedicated staff para po sa ating Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park kasi wala pa naman pong concrete project and wala pang concrete roles.

2349
03:19:17,800 --> 03:19:22,800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Sponsor, can the BCDA confirm that the agency?

2350
03:19:23,420 --> 03:19:39,620
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes, Madam Speaker. Sa lahat naman po ng proyekto ng BCDA, nagbibigay po ng due proper notice ang BCDA po.

2351
03:19:40,260 --> 03:19:51,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Bilang lead agency or government agency sa implementation ng Paxilica, paano isisiguro ng BCDA na compliant po tayo sa labor laws,

2352
03:19:51,520 --> 03:19:54,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang mga papasok na tech firms?

2353
03:19:55,660 --> 03:20:08,260
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, yung ating pong Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park ay ang masusunod po ay ang mga batas ng Pilipinas kasama po ang labor laws na i-implement po dito.

2354
03:20:08,720 --> 03:20:11,640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin po, tayo po ang masusunod?

2355
03:20:11,940 --> 03:20:13,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes po, Madam Speaker.

2356
03:20:13,240 --> 03:20:21,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Gandang balita po yun kung tayo yung nasusunod at hindi po tayo minamandohan ng ibang bansa or ng foreign.

2357
03:20:21,520 --> 03:20:29,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Saan sa Paxilica agreement nakasaad itong labor law compliance po?

2358
03:20:29,760 --> 03:20:40,640
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Sa ngayon po, wala pa po tayong agreement. So, yung ating pong sinusunod sa lahat po ng proyekto ng BCDA ay ang ating pong Philippine labor laws.

2359
03:20:41,140 --> 03:20:47,500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, ibig sabihin, wala pang provision or actual provision para dito. Pero yun yung plano.

2360
03:20:48,120 --> 03:20:50,160
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Wala pa pong agreement, Madam Speaker.

2361
03:20:51,520 --> 03:21:03,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung may kumpanyang non-compliant sa labor laws within the Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park, may kapangyarihan ba ang BCDA palayasin o pagbayarin sila?

2362
03:21:05,260 --> 03:21:17,460
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Again, Madam Speaker, sinisigurado po ng BCDA na Philippine labor laws will apply. Pero sa ngayon po, wala pa pong existing agreement. But this is what we can assure you po.

2363
03:21:17,900 --> 03:21:19,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Madam Sponsor.

2364
03:21:19,820 --> 03:21:21,400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana po ito po.

2365
03:21:21,520 --> 03:21:46,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya, magawa po talaga natin. Kasi ilang foreign countries na rin po ang pumasok sa ating bansa. Kagaya na lamang nung nakaraan, nagkaroon po ng labor strike ang ating mga DHL workers na kung saan sinasabi nilang labor laws ng Pilipinas ang sinusunod.

2366
03:21:46,740 --> 03:21:50,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: However, nung nagkaroon na ng union sa loob ng DHL.

2367
03:21:51,520 --> 03:21:56,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Eh, bigla na lamang silang in-end yung contract ng mga workers.

2368
03:21:57,060 --> 03:22:10,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, sana po, hindi lamang po ito pangako ng Paxilica, kundi talagang magkakaroon ng provision at talagang mapanagot po natin yung kumpanya na lalabag dito.

2369
03:22:10,860 --> 03:22:18,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: With that, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, ang susunod po na katanungan ko, follow up lamang po.

2370
03:22:18,780 --> 03:22:21,400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Saan sa Paxilica agreement naman?

2371
03:22:21,520 --> 03:22:29,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Saan po, nakasaad na may kapangyarihan ang BCDA na i-penalize ang mga non-compliant companies, kung meron man po?

2372
03:22:29,940 --> 03:22:41,260
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Again, Madam Speaker, wala pa pong agreement. Pero again, sinusigurado po ng BCDA na magiging compliant po tayo sa mga batas ng Pilipinas.

2373
03:22:42,060 --> 03:22:50,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana po, kung ano yung napag-usapan natin dito, uulitin ko po, kung sinasabi ninyo ganyan,

2374
03:22:50,340 --> 03:22:58,060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: maganda po yung balita. Pero hanggat wala pong agreement, wala pong provision, wala pong papel, nakakabahala pa rin po.

2375
03:22:59,640 --> 03:23:12,560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Susunod po na katanungan ko ay, paano naman po isisiguro ng BCDA na malayang makapag-unionize ang mga manggagawa sa loob ng mga development projects na ito?

2376
03:23:13,880 --> 03:23:17,680
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Again, Madam Speaker, we will follow Philippine labor laws.

2377
03:23:17,680 --> 03:23:21,160
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: At ito naman po ay nakasaad sa provision po natin.

2378
03:23:21,520 --> 03:23:30,860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaugnay po nung nangyari sa DHL, sana hindi po mangyari yung nangyari sa DHL na Philippine labor law ang sinunod,

2379
03:23:31,020 --> 03:23:39,140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero nung nagka-unionize, biglang umayaw na si DHL. So sana hindi po gano'n yung mangyayari dito.

2380
03:23:40,060 --> 03:23:46,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Paano naman po isisiguro ng BCDA na ang mga manggagawang Pilipino,

2381
03:23:46,020 --> 03:23:53,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang majority na mahahire sa mga high quality jobs sa Clark Advanced Manufacturing Park?

2382
03:23:53,700 --> 03:23:59,400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Baka naman po kasi dahil foreign country yung papasok dito,

2383
03:23:59,520 --> 03:24:04,440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: baka naman po dadalhin din nila yung kanilang mga manggagawa mula sa ibang bansa.

2384
03:24:16,020 --> 03:24:31,840
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ayon po sa ating BOI, ang nakasaad po ay minimum 90% po ang mga Pilipino na magtatrabaho.

2385
03:24:31,840 --> 03:24:37,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: As a-handing po natin yan na makikita natin sa provision or sa agreement po.

2386
03:24:38,800 --> 03:24:45,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At hindi ko na itatanong kung saan parte po yun ng agreement ng Paxilica dahil kagaya ng nasagot nyo po kanina,

2387
03:24:46,020 --> 03:24:49,500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: wala pa nga po. So sana nga, nandoon din po yan.

2388
03:24:50,980 --> 03:25:00,240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: As you can see, dear colleague, in the past months, Paxilica is toted as the economic miracle of the country.

2389
03:25:00,240 --> 03:25:04,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pero wala pa palang malinaw na agreement.

2390
03:25:04,600 --> 03:25:14,240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: It's extremely concerning na nag-hard launch na ang BCDA, nag-notify na sa LGU at sa mga residenteng maapektuhan.

2391
03:25:14,240 --> 03:25:20,620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pero ang sagot, lagi ay wala pa palang malinaw na kongkretong agreement.

2392
03:25:21,360 --> 03:25:28,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nagpadala na rin kayo ng notices sa mga residente, pero wala pa rin po palang agreement, no?

2393
03:25:28,700 --> 03:25:32,320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Are we being taken for a ride with this agreement?

2394
03:25:55,120 --> 03:26:04,620
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, as we said, wala pa pong final na mga pag-uusap.

2395
03:26:04,720 --> 03:26:06,440
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Meron pa lang pong mga diskusyon.

2396
03:26:07,000 --> 03:26:09,760
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Meron pa lang pong initial discussions.

2397
03:26:10,160 --> 03:26:14,160
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Kaya po, siguro kapag meron na pong feedback.

2398
03:26:14,240 --> 03:26:25,020
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: doon po natin maisasalaysay at mayuulat kung ano po yung magiging final agreements po natin.

2399
03:26:25,260 --> 03:26:28,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Naintindihan ko po ito Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

2400
03:26:30,060 --> 03:26:35,060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Medyo nabahala lang ako doon sa nakapag-notify na wala pa palang agreement,

2401
03:26:35,320 --> 03:26:40,900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: nasa usapan pa lang pala tayo kung ano-anong mga provisions ang gagawin natin.

2402
03:26:40,900 --> 03:26:50,700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi po yata tama na inonotify na natin ang mga residente para sila ay makaalis na tapos wala pa palang agreement.

2403
03:26:51,500 --> 03:26:58,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang 2027 budget ng BCDA, ang year zero bago magsimula ang construction.

2404
03:26:59,680 --> 03:27:05,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yet mukhang wala pa palang kapangyarihan ang lead agency para dito para masigurong

2405
03:27:05,740 --> 03:27:10,460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang mga Pilipino talaga ang magbe-benefit at hindi mga dayuhan.

2406
03:27:10,900 --> 03:27:20,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dadako naman po ako sa usapin at concerns ng indigenous people at mga community na maa-apektuhan ng development ng Paxilica.

2407
03:27:21,240 --> 03:27:30,920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Sponsor, para po sa inyong kaalaman at sa BCDA family, ako po ay isang indigenous people, isa po akong IP,

2408
03:27:31,240 --> 03:27:37,140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kaya mahalaga po sa akin yung karapatan ng aking mga constituent na mga IP, no?

2409
03:27:37,140 --> 03:27:40,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, can the BCDA confirm?

2410
03:27:40,900 --> 03:27:49,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: There are indigenous peoples and indigenous cultural communities that will be affected if the project pushes through.

2411
03:27:53,960 --> 03:28:00,320
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, siguro para magbigay po ng mas malawak na perspektibo,

2412
03:28:01,240 --> 03:28:10,320
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: yung pong Clark Freeport Special Economic Zone ay meron pong 35,300 hectares.

2413
03:28:10,900 --> 03:28:18,900
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: At ito pong camp na tinutukoy natin ay 1,620 hectares lamang.

2414
03:28:20,280 --> 03:28:30,780
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Doon po sa kabuan ng 35,300, inalis na po doon, binukod na po yung ating pong mga ancestral domain.

2415
03:28:31,240 --> 03:28:38,780
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Meron pong halos 15,000 na nakabukod na po na ginagalang ng BCDA.

2416
03:28:39,900 --> 03:28:40,780
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yung kanila pong...

2417
03:28:40,900 --> 03:28:53,380
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Pero dito po sa ating campsite, wala pa po, even at the NCIP level, wala pong CAD-T or CALT na nare-recognize pa po.

2418
03:28:54,520 --> 03:28:58,220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po, no? Magandang balita kung sakaling ganun nga talaga.

2419
03:28:58,440 --> 03:29:02,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dahil ibig sabihin, pinapahalagahan po natin ang mga indigenous people.

2420
03:29:03,480 --> 03:29:10,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Gayun pa man po, gusto ko lang i-follow up na naintindihan ko na sinegregate na po natin,

2421
03:29:10,900 --> 03:29:13,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: gagal na po natin yung mga may ancestral domain.

2422
03:29:14,040 --> 03:29:21,220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngayon, ang tanong ko po, may mga communities pa rin po ba na maapektuhan na sila ay mga indigenous people,

2423
03:29:21,360 --> 03:29:23,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ngunit wala lang ancestral domain?

2424
03:29:59,080 --> 03:30:08,460
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, doon po sa New Clark City Special Economic Zone, Freeport and Special Economic Zone,

2425
03:30:08,660 --> 03:30:19,100
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: meron pong ilang both IP and non-IP na settlers po.

2426
03:30:19,960 --> 03:30:28,700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, ibig sabihin may maaapektuhan ng mga IP community na walang ancestral domain.

2427
03:30:28,700 --> 03:30:34,240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Doon po sa area, nakasama sa 35,300 hectares.

2428
03:30:35,560 --> 03:30:48,880
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Doon po sa camp area, doon sa 1,600 hectares po, meron po na ilang mga IP and non-IP families.

2429
03:30:49,440 --> 03:30:55,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano po kaya ang magiging commitment ng BCDA na itong mga IP na to,

2430
03:30:55,820 --> 03:30:58,540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: despite not having an ancestral domain,

2431
03:30:58,700 --> 03:31:04,320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay maa-re-remain ang kanilang dignidad,

2432
03:31:04,840 --> 03:31:10,040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ma-re-respeto pa rin ang kanilang rights as an indigenous people.

2433
03:31:10,820 --> 03:31:21,680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can the BCDA commit na meron pa rin po tayong i-implace or i-impose na batas para sa ating mga IP constituents

2434
03:31:21,680 --> 03:31:24,840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na even if wala po silang ancestral domain?

2435
03:31:28,700 --> 03:31:43,220
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, para po doon sa affected families, IP families po natin,

2436
03:31:43,700 --> 03:31:52,640
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: BCDA will coordinate with NCIP and the LGU para po matukoy ang kanila pong saloobin

2437
03:31:52,640 --> 03:31:58,680
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: at siyempre tignan po kung ano po yung pwedeng mabigay natin.

2438
03:31:58,700 --> 03:32:01,320
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: May tulong ng ating pong gobyerno sa kanila.

2439
03:32:02,260 --> 03:32:08,960
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Hindi po natin sila, hindi isasama sa ating pong developmental and social plan.

2440
03:32:10,280 --> 03:32:22,920
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Definitely po, hindi po natin hahayaan na wala po tayong ibibigay na alternatibong option para po sa kanila.

2441
03:32:23,540 --> 03:32:25,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, distinguished sponsor.

2442
03:32:26,820 --> 03:32:27,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: With that,

2443
03:32:28,700 --> 03:32:30,560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: nire-respeto ko po ito,

2444
03:32:30,640 --> 03:32:33,400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero bilang ang BCDA po,

2445
03:32:33,740 --> 03:32:40,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang lead government agency na magli-lead dito sa Paxilica project na ito,

2446
03:32:40,820 --> 03:32:49,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sana po ay kayo po mismo yung bababa sa grounds at kakausap sa mga IP constituents or even non-IP constituents.

2447
03:32:50,960 --> 03:32:55,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Huwag po sana nating hayaan na ang sulat lang, written document lang,

2448
03:32:55,420 --> 03:32:58,680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang mag-i-inform sa kanila ng ano na pong,

2449
03:32:58,700 --> 03:33:05,440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kung nangyayari doon po sa area of responsibility din po ng proyektong ito.

2450
03:33:05,980 --> 03:33:16,480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, inaasahan ko po, sana po ay makita po natin itong improvement at saka progress po dito sa pagkakausap po sa ating mga IP constituents.

2451
03:33:17,440 --> 03:33:22,760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: With that, Madam Speaker, distinguished sponsor, for closing, in closing,

2452
03:33:24,300 --> 03:33:28,660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pasensya na po pero medyo hindi ko po kasi naiintindihan kung bakit,

2453
03:33:28,660 --> 03:33:35,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: minamadali din po natin yung Paxilica at ang mga planong Advanced Manufacturing Park

2454
03:33:35,820 --> 03:33:39,840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng marami pang hindi nasasagot ng mga concerns.

2455
03:33:40,440 --> 03:33:47,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana po, unahin po natin muna yung mga concerns bago po natin madaliin ang mga agreements na ito.

2456
03:33:48,560 --> 03:33:53,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Malinaw naman sa ating mga Pinoy na kung hindi nakataga sa bato,

2457
03:33:53,600 --> 03:33:58,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang mga pangako ay posibleng napapakataon.

2458
03:33:58,660 --> 03:33:59,700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Napapako, no?

2459
03:34:00,120 --> 03:34:02,720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, yun lamang po ang gusto naming makita.

2460
03:34:02,980 --> 03:34:10,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana ito ay nakadokumento, may papeles, may agreement, may probisyon na magsesecure

2461
03:34:10,780 --> 03:34:17,480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na hindi po masisira ang ating kalikasan, ang ating bansa, at ang ating komunidad.

2462
03:34:17,480 --> 03:34:25,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Baka mauwi lang sa pambubudol ang mga pangakong high quality jobs, mga pangakong world class technology,

2463
03:34:26,540 --> 03:34:28,480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: transfer kung wala naman pala tayo.

2464
03:34:28,660 --> 03:34:30,480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya yung nakikita pa sa agreement.

2465
03:34:31,100 --> 03:34:34,920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: But anyway, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, maraming salamat po.

2466
03:34:35,120 --> 03:34:36,060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker.

2467
03:34:36,060 --> 03:34:36,880
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

2468
03:34:37,000 --> 03:34:37,700
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: ...

2469
03:34:37,840 --> 03:34:42,820
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize Representative Ko for her interpellation.

2470
03:34:42,980 --> 03:34:45,260
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Ko is hereby recognized. Please proceed.

2471
03:34:46,820 --> 03:34:48,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

2472
03:34:49,120 --> 03:34:53,380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Magandang gabi sa ating Distinguished Sponsor ngayong gabi.

2473
03:34:54,140 --> 03:34:58,380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maari po bang sumagot ng ilang tanong tungkol sa...

2474
03:34:58,660 --> 03:35:04,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa budget at mga pulisiya na gusto pong ipatupad ng BCDA?

2475
03:35:05,120 --> 03:35:06,080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes, Madam Speaker.

2476
03:35:06,600 --> 03:35:08,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker. Good sponsor.

2477
03:35:09,440 --> 03:35:14,020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang una po nating tanong ay ang announcement din,

2478
03:35:14,020 --> 03:35:19,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi lang ng BCDA pero iba-iba rin pong ahensya ng gobyerno

2479
03:35:19,360 --> 03:35:27,740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng April 16, 2026, pumirma ang Pilipinas sa Pax Silica Declaration.

2480
03:35:27,740 --> 03:35:31,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can I get a confirmation if that's true, Madam Speaker? Good sponsor?

2481
03:35:32,500 --> 03:35:33,820
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes, Madam Speaker.

2482
03:35:35,080 --> 03:35:40,320
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Pumirma po ang Pilipinas sa isang non-binding statement of shared principles.

2483
03:35:42,320 --> 03:35:44,280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2484
03:35:45,040 --> 03:35:53,940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa website ng Board of Investments na nakuha natin ang access dito dahil dinirect po tayo

2485
03:35:53,940 --> 03:35:57,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng Board of Investments mismo sa DTI.

2486
03:35:58,700 --> 03:36:04,300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: budget briefing. Meron po ditong sulat, liham galing sa BCDA

2487
03:36:04,300 --> 03:36:21,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ?Proposal for a Pax Silica Coordination Office in Clark,? dated April 9, 2026. May I get a confirmation kung ito po ay pinadala ng BCDA?

2488
03:36:21,000 --> 03:36:23,600
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes, Madam Speaker.

2489
03:36:23,600 --> 03:36:26,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, meron po tayong mga katanungan

2490
03:36:26,400 --> 03:36:29,300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: tungkol po sa liham na ito

2491
03:36:29,300 --> 03:36:46,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At ang mga nagsunod-sunod ng developments na nag-arise from the signing of this statement and subsequent plans, proposals, declarations ng iba't-ibang ahensya ng gobyerno.

2492
03:36:46,120 --> 03:37:15,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ayon po dito sa April 9, 2026 letter ng BCDA, binubukas niya po ang 4,000 hectares acres strategically located in the Luzon Economic Corridor under a lease-free agreement may grace period of two years bilang offer of in-kind contribution towards developing and advancing the bilateral economic security partnership between the governments of the Philippines

2493
03:37:16,120 --> 03:37:45,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and the United States of America. May scope and objectives, meron pong paglatag ng terms at ng legal basis. Ang tanong ko po, if the offer of land proceeded or was simultaneous with the country's formal partnership, ano pong otoridad o propriety na meron ng BCDA to commit up to 4,000 acres of sovereign state land to a foreign coalition,

2494
03:37:45,180 --> 03:37:50,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the Philippines had not yet formally joined. Madam Speaker, good sponsor, maaari po ba tayong ma-enlighten dito?

2495
03:37:51,260 --> 03:38:13,020
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, katulad po ng nabanggit ng ating distinguished colleague, ito po ay isang proposal na pinadala po ng BCDA. Hindi po ito na iba sa mga proposal na pinapadala ng BCDA bilang isang IPA or Investment Promotions Agency. Ito po kasi talaga yung mandato nila.

2496
03:38:15,180 --> 03:38:26,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, ano pong basihan kung bakit nagbukas ng proposal ang BCDA ng April 9, 2026 via letter sa Estados Unidos?

2497
03:38:40,140 --> 03:38:44,980
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ang basihan po ng proposal na pinadala ng BCDA.

2498
03:38:45,180 --> 03:38:56,220
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: ay yung mismong Republic Act na nag-create sa BCDA plus po yung isa pa po nating batas na Investor's Lease Act.

2499
03:38:58,580 --> 03:39:05,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mayroon po bang mga relevant agencies o kaya po ang presidente na nag-authorize ng offer na ito in advance?

2500
03:39:05,680 --> 03:39:13,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Was anyone outside the BCDA involved in crafting this offer and authorizing this offer?

2501
03:39:15,180 --> 03:39:40,580
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ito pong proposal ay bunga ng ating pong pagsapi sa deklarasyon at dahil ito po ay pinadala sa ibang bansa, ito po ay nireview ng iba't ibang mga national agencies cleared para ipadala ng BCDA.

2502
03:39:40,580 --> 03:39:44,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, to clarify, ano pong deklarasyon na ito?

2503
03:39:45,180 --> 03:39:46,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Na na-mention ninyo?

2504
03:39:47,140 --> 03:39:48,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung Paxilica Declaration po.

2505
03:39:48,860 --> 03:40:03,100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero ang tanong Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, prior to the sending of this letter ng April 9, ang presidente po ba o kahit anong relevant na ahensya ng gobyerno nag-authorize in advance of this offer?

2506
03:40:03,240 --> 03:40:05,760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So prior to April 9, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

2507
03:40:06,760 --> 03:40:15,520
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes, Madam Speaker, kinlear po ito ng DOJ at in-endorse po ng DTI, ng DFA.

2508
03:40:15,820 --> 03:40:25,200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So may clearance, endorsement ng DOJ and DFA prior to April 9, prior to sending the proposal?

2509
03:40:25,740 --> 03:40:26,700
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes, Madam Speaker.

2510
03:40:27,440 --> 03:40:35,240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kailan po ito ginawa ng DOJ and DFA? Kailan po na-receive ng BCDA itong clearances and endorsements?

2511
03:40:38,900 --> 03:40:40,240
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ito po ay...

2512
03:40:45,180 --> 03:40:59,900
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: The day before April 9, Madam Speaker.

2513
03:41:01,120 --> 03:41:08,500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Bakit po, curiosity, ang DOJ kailangang i-clear at i-endorse itong offer na ito?

2514
03:41:15,180 --> 03:41:26,780
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: To ensure po na ito po ay compliant sa ating pong BCDA Act at sa Investors Lease Act.

2515
03:41:27,240 --> 03:41:29,980
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: And Philippine laws po, Madam Speaker.

2516
03:41:30,160 --> 03:41:39,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, is the DepDev ever consulted about the offer prior to the BCDA making it?

2517
03:41:39,680 --> 03:41:52,880
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Hindi po, Madam Speaker, kasi ito po ay isang preliminary proposal pa lang po.

2518
03:41:54,520 --> 03:42:07,320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Other than the DOJ and DFA, Madam Speaker, good sponsor, sino pa po ba involved dito sa pagbuo ng terms, ng scope ng proposal na ito?

2519
03:42:11,220 --> 03:42:16,060
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Aside from DOJ, DFA, BCDA po, and BOI.

2520
03:42:17,120 --> 03:42:38,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, kung maari din po natin makuha yun in a report na paglalatag ng sino pong mga ahensya, sino pong mga heads of agencies ang involved sa pagbuo ng proposal because I assume this high level of proposal, kahit sabihin mang preliminary,

2521
03:42:38,900 --> 03:42:57,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: marami pong recurso ang pinag-uusapan, ang tinataya, at hindi naman po basta-basta lang na mga ahensya na hindi na konsulta sa appropriate other government bodies na magagawa ito.

2522
03:42:57,040 --> 03:42:58,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2523
03:42:58,880 --> 03:42:59,420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes, Madam Speaker.

2524
03:42:59,420 --> 03:43:08,740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung maari din po ang mga dates at inputs at mga endorsements na ginawa na relevant ng mga DOJ, ng mga ahensya.

2525
03:43:10,600 --> 03:43:13,200
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes, Madam Speaker, we will comply.

2526
03:43:13,200 --> 03:43:38,880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So Madam Speaker, good sponsor, ang sunod nating tanong: ang Department of Agriculture o ang Department of Agrarian Reform ba nakonsulta ng BCDA bago po binuksan sa isang offer ang lupain na in-identify for Pax Silica, given that the site displaces active farmland in Tarlac?

2527
03:43:38,900 --> 03:43:57,400
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, ito pong pinag-uusapan po natin, public land under Clark Freeport and special economic zone, ito po ay naka-master plan na bilang isang economic zone po for industrial development.

2528
03:43:57,400 --> 03:44:03,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So Madam Speaker, good sponsor, is the sponsor denying agricultural displacement?

2529
03:44:08,900 --> 03:44:16,580
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, hindi po classified as agricultural land itong pinag-uusapan po nating subject area.

2530
03:44:17,860 --> 03:44:26,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, may sinasayit na essentially legal tag sa lupain na ito.

2531
03:44:26,600 --> 03:44:38,500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang reality, however, ay around May this year, residents of Barangay Santa Lucia, Capas, says that PCDA sent a one-month eviction notice.

2532
03:44:38,900 --> 03:44:40,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Without prior consultation.

2533
03:44:40,920 --> 03:44:47,380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And several farmers also claimed PCDA had offered to purchase their land for only 30 pesos per square meter.

2534
03:44:47,640 --> 03:44:59,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And in August, around 92 farmers in Barangay O'Donnell, Capas, Tarlac have reportedly been urged by the PCDA to vacate the farmland they have been cultivating.

2535
03:45:00,000 --> 03:45:16,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Residents of Sitio Sapangkawayan, Barangay Aranguren, said the project could displace families from ancestral land where generations have lived and farmed while also putting their burial grounds, livelihood, and community institutions at risk.

2536
03:45:16,600 --> 03:45:31,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May mga senators po calling for a Senate probe amid complaints that farmers are allegedly being ordered to stop planting and are facing intimidation, arguing any land use conversion must follow due process under DAR rules.

2537
03:45:31,720 --> 03:45:39,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Marami po tayong data, gaya na rin po sa preliminary, and preliminary pa lang po ito, na studies ng mga ibang ahensya.

2538
03:45:39,000 --> 03:45:44,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The DA noted that 15,200 farmers might lose their agricultural land.

2539
03:45:44,700 --> 03:45:52,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And a civil society organization, Calicasan, said the project could result in the long-term displacement of around 20,000 AITA residents.

2540
03:45:53,760 --> 03:45:59,420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May sinasabi po na hindi po ito tagged as agricultural land.

2541
03:45:59,600 --> 03:46:07,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But is the BCDA aware of this when it made the proposal na may 20,000 AITA residents na nariyan?

2542
03:46:07,400 --> 03:46:12,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron pong 15,200 farmers na maaari pong mawala ang kanilang lupain.

2543
03:46:13,300 --> 03:46:14,500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At ngayon po.

2544
03:46:14,700 --> 03:46:18,760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito po yung paraan kung paano niya pinapatigil ito.

2545
03:46:19,300 --> 03:46:25,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Reports of harassment, intimidation, para makuha, maklear yung lupain.

2546
03:46:26,080 --> 03:46:27,140
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2547
03:46:27,760 --> 03:46:30,120
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

2548
03:46:30,620 --> 03:46:38,760
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Siguro parang meron pong discrepancy sa mga bilang na, malalaking mga bilang na naisalaysay po ninyo.

2549
03:46:39,500 --> 03:46:44,680
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: We would like to request for a copy of this para ma-review po ng BCDA.

2550
03:46:44,700 --> 03:46:57,700
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Pero sa ngayon po, wala pong 20,000 farmers displaced and wala rin pong 20,000 AITAS displaced.

2551
03:46:58,880 --> 03:47:07,040
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: In fact, again, ito pong pinag-uusapan po nating lupa ay special economic zone, hindi po siya agricultural.

2552
03:47:07,040 --> 03:47:14,680
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: And yung kabuan po ng 35,300 hectares, nakabukod po.

2553
03:47:14,700 --> 03:47:20,040
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ito po yung mga lupain na under ng DAR area.

2554
03:47:20,860 --> 03:47:26,960
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ito po ay merong kabuang 10,700 hectares under DAR farmlands.

2555
03:47:27,880 --> 03:47:29,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2556
03:47:29,320 --> 03:47:40,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: To clarify, ang binigay ng mga numero ng kinatawan na ito ay mga estimates kung tuloy-tuloy na mangyari yung mga displacement na ongoing na po ngayon.

2557
03:47:40,580 --> 03:47:44,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So ito po ay mga public pronouncements from civil society.

2558
03:47:44,700 --> 03:47:50,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito po ay mga public pronouncements from civil society organizations na maaari din pong i-furnish ng representasyon na ito ng kopya.

2559
03:47:50,580 --> 03:48:04,420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But nonetheless, ang tanong po natin ay despite yung pagsabi na meron pong ganitong pagtag na this is land under special economic zone.

2560
03:48:04,980 --> 03:48:06,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang reality po, may AITA po doon.

2561
03:48:06,840 --> 03:48:09,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nagpunta po tayo, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2562
03:48:10,140 --> 03:48:14,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron pong nagkiklaim that for the longest time, naroon sila sa lupa.

2563
03:48:14,700 --> 03:48:16,720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ngayon, burial ground din po nila.

2564
03:48:17,120 --> 03:48:21,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: They have been farming for generations in the land that was provided.

2565
03:48:21,460 --> 03:48:22,740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2566
03:48:22,860 --> 03:48:32,760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang tanong ko, may FPIC po bang obtained from or even sought from the AITA community in Sitio, Sapang, Kawayan before the offer was extended to a foreign government?

2567
03:48:32,760 --> 03:48:43,880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nagkaroon po ba ng opportunity ang BCDA para i-check na okay, kahit ito nakalagay as special economic zone land to na may mga magsasaka po doon?

2568
03:48:44,700 --> 03:48:49,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kinausap, kinonsulta, kinuha yung FPIC bago po ginawa yung offer na ito.

2569
03:48:50,280 --> 03:48:58,060
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, ito pong pinag-uusapan po nating area para po sa camp.

2570
03:48:58,580 --> 03:49:00,960
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Wala pong ancestral domain dito.

2571
03:49:01,460 --> 03:49:03,660
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Wala pong CADT or CALT po dito.

2572
03:49:04,120 --> 03:49:05,720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2573
03:49:05,920 --> 03:49:14,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Under the Indigenous People's Rights Act, FPIC is supposed to precede decisions affecting ancestral domain, not follow a commitment.

2574
03:49:14,700 --> 03:49:16,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Already made internationally.

2575
03:49:17,220 --> 03:49:20,980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So I'd like to confirm, i-confirm yung sequence.

2576
03:49:21,260 --> 03:49:28,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The land was offered to the U.S. for the Paxilica project bago po magkaroon ng any consultation,

2577
03:49:28,680 --> 03:49:33,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: even though sinabi na as of now, wala pong CADT.

2578
03:49:35,460 --> 03:49:38,800
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Wala pong FPIC kasi po wala pong CADT.

2579
03:49:40,440 --> 03:49:42,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2580
03:49:42,380 --> 03:49:43,620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang sunod po nating tanong.

2581
03:49:44,000 --> 03:49:44,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And I'd like to...

2582
03:49:44,700 --> 03:49:47,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Loop back and circle back to that data, no?

2583
03:49:47,220 --> 03:49:54,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Given that BCDA has acknowledged on the record at the August 14th Senate hearing that consultations have not been completed

2584
03:49:54,700 --> 03:49:59,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and investors have yet to submit a development plan,

2585
03:49:59,380 --> 03:50:04,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: does BCDA consider it appropriate governance practice to make an international commitment first

2586
03:50:04,640 --> 03:50:11,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and complete domestic due diligence, agricultural impact, environmental assessment, indigenous consent,

2587
03:50:11,980 --> 03:50:14,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: local government coordination pagkatapos?

2588
03:50:14,220 --> 03:50:30,020
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, again, ito pong subject area na pinag-uusapan po natin ay special freeport, freeport and special economic zone.

2589
03:50:31,620 --> 03:50:36,220
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yung ating pong proposal ay preliminary lamang po.

2590
03:50:37,460 --> 03:50:42,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Kaya po wala pong FPIC na ginanap.

2591
03:50:42,540 --> 03:50:43,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Kasi po hindi po...

2592
03:50:44,220 --> 03:50:49,700
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Wala pong ancestral domain dito po sa subject area.

2593
03:50:50,380 --> 03:50:51,500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2594
03:50:51,700 --> 03:50:58,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Paano po hinaharap ng BCDA yung issue na lumalabas ngayon ang mga iilang magsasaka

2595
03:50:58,160 --> 03:51:04,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: that they're claiming na may ancestral lands and domain po sila?

2596
03:51:04,180 --> 03:51:08,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sabihin po natin na as of now, there is no certificate.

2597
03:51:08,920 --> 03:51:13,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero may grupo pong lumalabas, sinasabi ang doon sila.

2598
03:51:13,140 --> 03:51:16,920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron silang pruweba that they've been occupying that for the longest time.

2599
03:51:17,620 --> 03:51:25,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi po ba dapat i-halt natin ang lahat at kausapin sila, i-finalize, i-clear po itong lahat bago tayo mag-proceed?

2600
03:51:26,120 --> 03:51:34,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Because unfortunately, Madam Speaker, good sponsor, ang nakita natin na developments posted by the U.S. Embassy in the Philippines

2601
03:51:34,640 --> 03:51:36,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and covered by...

2602
03:51:37,760 --> 03:51:43,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and even posted by the United States Secretary of State.

2603
03:51:43,140 --> 03:51:47,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Jacob Helberg ay may Pax Silica marker nang ina-unveil.

2604
03:51:47,560 --> 03:51:52,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi po ba ito, hindi ba advanced masyado ang thinking dito?

2605
03:51:52,460 --> 03:51:56,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo na't may naghahabol na nandyan po ang lupain namin.

2606
03:51:56,880 --> 03:52:01,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At syempre, madidisplace kami, mawawalan po kami ng lupa kung tutuloy-tuloy ito.

2607
03:52:13,140 --> 03:52:39,640
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, again, itong subject area ay Freeport and Special Economic Zone.

2608
03:52:39,640 --> 03:52:42,920
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Kaya po, mandato po ng BCDA.

2609
03:52:43,140 --> 03:52:52,900
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Na as an investments promotions agency, na magamit ito for productive use para po sa matugunan yung kanilang mandato.

2610
03:52:53,840 --> 03:53:01,200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, with all due respect to our colleague and of course, sa pagkilala pa rin naman ng batas at mandato ng iba't ibang ahensya,

2611
03:53:03,040 --> 03:53:04,200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: maaari po nating...

2612
03:53:05,600 --> 03:53:11,200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: This representation can think of various answers to that question such as,

2613
03:53:11,460 --> 03:53:12,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pwede po nating itigil?

2614
03:53:13,140 --> 03:53:23,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I-pause muna ang pagproseso ng proyekto until ma-resolve natin yung mga issues regarding farmers that have conflicting claims about the land.

2615
03:53:24,140 --> 03:53:34,920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Despite the fact na may saklaw nga pong batas, despite the fact na may identified lands, na sinasabi ito po, Special Economic Zone ito.

2616
03:53:34,920 --> 03:53:40,100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, meron pong mga claims ang mga farmers.

2617
03:53:40,780 --> 03:53:42,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May claims ang ITAS.

2618
03:53:42,080 --> 03:53:43,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ITAS po ang mga farmers.

2619
03:53:43,140 --> 03:53:55,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung pinakaunang mga tribo na nakalapag sa Pilipinas, sa kasaysayan natin, they predate the concept of the Philippine State.

2620
03:53:56,320 --> 03:54:07,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And most likely, they can make claims as long as meron silang evidence which even might predate yung concept ng mga batas natin dito ngayon.

2621
03:54:07,360 --> 03:54:12,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, hindi po ba natin dapat ikonsidera yung kanilang mga...

2622
03:54:13,140 --> 03:54:24,880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nilalapag ng mga threat, banta sa kanilang buhay, sa kanilang kabuhayan, bago po mag-proceed further sa ganitong proyekto?

2623
03:54:25,420 --> 03:54:30,320
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, wala pong threat sa kanilang mga buhay.

2624
03:54:31,320 --> 03:54:39,660
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Alam po ng ating mga farmers na itong lupa na ito ay nakatitulo sa BCDA.

2625
03:54:39,980 --> 03:54:42,980
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ito po ay Freeport and Special Economic Zone.

2626
03:54:43,140 --> 03:54:53,240
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Claro po ito sa kanila sa mga dialogues and sa mga groundwork na ginagawa po ng BCDA.

2627
03:54:54,020 --> 03:55:02,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, I find it hard to believe na tatanggapin na lang po ng mga ITA tribes, ng mga grupo ng mga magsasaka,

2628
03:55:02,680 --> 03:55:10,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na may pumunta pong biglang mga government officials and employees in suits at sasabihin nila,

2629
03:55:10,780 --> 03:55:13,020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: actually po, yung lupang tinitilikan ninyo.

2630
03:55:13,260 --> 03:55:17,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pagmamayari po yan ng pamahalaan, kailangan na pong i-clear dahil po may proyekto pong pupunta dyan.

2631
03:55:18,440 --> 03:55:25,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, let just the record show that this representation repeatedly asked,

2632
03:55:26,180 --> 03:55:35,660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung ano pong response ng BCDA sa mga paulit-ulit na concerns ng mga magsasaka, ng mga tribo na sinasabi,

2633
03:55:36,220 --> 03:55:42,760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dito po kami nakatira, dito po ang aming kabuhayan, and the response that I've been getting is,

2634
03:55:43,140 --> 03:55:53,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: but the law provides that this particular land is part and tag under the applicable laws like the Special Economic Zone.

2635
03:55:54,060 --> 03:56:00,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, as I have my time is limited, I would move on to the next line of questioning,

2636
03:56:01,380 --> 03:56:09,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at tungkol naman po ito sa mismong batas na nire-refer, which is RA 7916, or the Special Economic Zone Act,

2637
03:56:09,840 --> 03:56:12,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na pinasa in 1995 with the express...

2638
03:56:13,140 --> 03:56:20,020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: statutory purpose of promoting technology-intensive industries that will modernize the country's industrial sector

2639
03:56:20,020 --> 03:56:27,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and enabling technology transfer and managerial know-how to transfer them to domestic firms.

2640
03:56:27,700 --> 03:56:36,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Three decades later, gusto po natin makita from BCDA to cite specific, measurable instances of technology transfer

2641
03:56:36,580 --> 03:56:42,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and modernization of industrial sector directly due to PESA-registered firms,

2642
03:56:43,140 --> 03:56:49,240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or Philippine-owned manufacturing capacity, not just employment figures but, Madam Speaker, to note,

2643
03:56:49,240 --> 03:57:00,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: IP transfer, domestic supplier upgrading, or Filipino-owned firms that graduated into higher value-added production because of eco-zone spillovers.

2644
03:57:00,440 --> 03:57:03,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Is that data available right now, Madam Speaker, good sponsor?

2645
03:57:05,540 --> 03:57:12,980
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Right now, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, wala pa yung data sa amin, but we will, if you will allow, we will submit that.

2646
03:57:14,800 --> 03:57:43,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, aantayin po natin yung report na iyon dahil po kung ang sinasabi na rason kung bakit po dapat magkaroon ng Pax Silica ay ang basehan ay ang Special Economic Zone Act, it has been in place actually three decades now. So we would like to see ano po ba yung naging progress from when it was passed up to now kung paano po

2647
03:57:43,120 --> 03:57:54,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, inactualize yung batas. Paano po nagkaroon ng technology-intensive industries dahil po nagkaroon ng modernization of industrial sector

2648
03:57:54,900 --> 03:58:01,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na supposedly BCDA is at the lead if not one of the agencies ought to implement this.

2649
03:58:01,800 --> 03:58:05,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, iintayin po natin yung report na iyon.

2650
03:58:06,120 --> 03:58:07,020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes, Madam Speaker.

2651
03:58:07,020 --> 03:58:13,020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang final question na lang po, Madam Speaker, may napansin tayo that in that proportion,

2652
03:58:13,120 --> 03:58:22,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the proposal letter to the U.S. State Department, it does explicitly state that RA 7916 is the governing law for personnel arrangements at the site.

2653
03:58:23,100 --> 03:58:33,920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero po, noong July, BCDA's president told the press that the project would instead be covered by the BCDA law and create more.

2654
03:58:33,920 --> 03:58:41,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, we'd like to clarify, which fiscal and legal framework ultimately governs the Paxilica Coordination Office?

2655
03:58:42,300 --> 03:58:43,100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2656
03:58:43,120 --> 03:59:05,900
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ang legal basis po ay yung BCDA law at yung create more, which is an update of the 7916 RA.

2657
03:59:06,680 --> 03:59:09,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

2658
03:59:10,960 --> 03:59:12,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Iintay natin yung iba't-ibang...

2659
03:59:13,120 --> 03:59:16,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Iintay natin yung mga reports na ni-request ng kinatawa na ito.

2660
03:59:16,640 --> 03:59:20,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But as a final manifestation, Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

2661
03:59:21,620 --> 03:59:30,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang mga napansin natin, mga iba't-ibang arrangements na in-undertake under the Special Economic Zone Act,

2662
03:59:30,920 --> 03:59:34,980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we surmise it won't be as different sa gagawin sa Paxilica.

2663
03:59:34,980 --> 03:59:42,980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And given three decades of implementation under these models, we'd like to see from BCDA concrete evidence,

2664
03:59:43,120 --> 03:59:53,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: not just projections, that these incentives have generated domestic supply chains,

2665
03:59:53,720 --> 04:00:00,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: import substitution industrialization, or measurable technology transfer into Filipino-owned...

